GS
[0.75 0 0 0.75 0 0] CT
1 GC
N
0 0 1200 500 re
f
GR
GS
[0.48 0 0 0.48015 0 134.92319] CT
[1 0 0 1 0 0] CT
N
0 -281 M
1875 -281 L
1875 500 L
0 500 L
0 -281 L
cp
clip
GS
0 0 translate
1200 500 scale
